    "All three utility BIN assets use only the recovered DOS text attribute byte values 7, 9, 11, 12, 14, and 15; each attribute is preserved verbatim per cell rather than interpreted as a modern color name.",
    "WCCADDON.SYS is a nine-record LF-delimited slot/token table with contiguous slots 1 through 9.",
    "WCCDMA.SYS is a 152-record LF-delimited three-field table: IPv4 address, fixed-width eight-digit identifier, and uppercase token.",
    "WCCDMA tokens are unique in the supplied file; identifiers are not unique, so the identifier alone is not a record key."
  ],
